epos/godotengine/godot/issues/120088","id":4657986345,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABFaM7KQ","user":{"login":"blueskythlikesclouds","id":19259897,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MjU5ODk3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19259897?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds","html_url":"https://github.com/blueskythlikesclouds","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-09T08:42:54Z","updated_at":"2026-06-09T09:13:23Z","body":"> Is there a suggested project I should add your example code to test?\r\n\r\nAny GPU bound project would do (I tried godot-sponza with max settings), but you may not see any performance difference since I figure Apple devices have proper async transfer queues. ","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4657986345/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4665220209","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120088#issuecomment-4665220209","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120088","id":4665220209,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABFhGccQ","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-10T00:08:09Z","updated_at":"2026-06-10T00:13:54Z","body":"> I also added support for discrete GPUs with ReBAR to use this path.\r\n\r\nNote for testers: ReBAR generally requires the application to be explicitly allowed in the graphics driver to use it, as it's not enabled for every application by default (to avoid performance regressions in specific applications).\r\n\r\nOn Windows, this can be forced using [NVIDIA Profile Inspector](https://github.com/Orbmu2k/nvidiaProfileInspector). On Linux, this might not be necessary and ReBAR might actually be enabled for all applications. Check the value listed in `nvidia-settings` on the tab with the GPU name:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"287\" height=\"21\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c1babfa6-e46d-449b-b248-d1f1ef7737f8\" />\r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4665220209/reactions","total_co